      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA SOPHIE (3) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and three placings from nine starts. Recorded a 2 length win (29.57) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. ENTERTAINER (1) was well fancied last time on the back of some sparkling form, which included a two-start winning streak, but could only manage fifth (30.48) at Richmond. Won at his only start from this draw. Cannot be left out. SPEEDY ZIPPER (4) was prominent throughout when winning in the fastest time of the card two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 10 lengths at this track (30.63). In the mix. DONE DEALING (6) is in form and worth thought again.",
